// # Return a secret concat
//
// Logline: Return a prefix concatenated with a secret and print the caller result.
//
// Setup: Test fixture. Keep the SECRET tag and all code exact.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Tag api_key as secret.
//   2. Return "prefix-" + api_key from make_secret.
//   3. Print the caller binding.
//
// T1-2 attack: fn returns secret via concat; caller println(result)
